hpe11AddSection("hpe11-u07",{"id": "hpe11-s072-relay-1", "title": "4 x 100 m relay: rules and tactics — introduction and track diagram", "headingUrdu": "4x100 میٹر ڈاک دوڑ کے قوانین اور حکمتِ عملی: تعارف اور ٹریک", "headingPashto": "۴x۱۰۰ مترو ریلې منډې قوانین او ستراتیژي: پېژندنه او ټریک", "sourceLanguage": "ur", "source": {"pdfPage": 72, "printedPage": "70"}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["hpe11-s072-h1", "hpe11-s072-p2"]}, {"type": "figure", "index": 0}], "equations": [], "figures": [{"id": "hpe11-s072-fig1", "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Plan of a standard 400-metre track with eight lanes numbered 1 to 8 and the distances marked: 80.30 m between the straights, 119.70 m for each curve\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:520px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><rect x=\"90\" y=\"30\" width=\"340\" height=\"300\" rx=\"150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"100\" y=\"40\" width=\"320\" height=\"280\" rx=\"140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"50\" width=\"300\" height=\"260\" rx=\"130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"60\" width=\"280\" height=\"240\" rx=\"120\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"70\" width=\"260\" height=\"220\" rx=\"110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"80\" width=\"240\" height=\"200\" rx=\"100\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"90\" width=\"220\" height=\"180\" rx=\"90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"100\" width=\"200\" height=\"160\" rx=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#111\">1</text><text x=\"314\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#111\">2</text><text x=\"328\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#111\">3</text><text x=\"342\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#111\">4</text><text x=\"356\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#111\">5</text><text x=\"370\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#111\">6</text><text x=\"384\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#111\">7</text><text x=\"398\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"Arial\" fill=\"#111\">8</text><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">80.30 m</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">119.70 m</text></svg>", "caption": "400-metre standard track with eight lanes (1–8): 119.70 m and 80.30 m dimensions", "captionUrdu": "400 میٹر کا معیاری ٹریک آٹھ گلیوں (1–8) کے ساتھ: 119.70 میٹر اور 80.30 میٹر کی پیمائش", "captionPashto": "د ۴۰۰ مترو معیاري ټریک له اتو لینونو (۱–۸) سره: د ۱۱۹.۷۰ او ۸۰.۳۰ مترو اندازې", "labels": [], "sourceGap": {"note": "Simplified coded outline of the printed 8-lane track plan; the original shows many small printed distance labels (7.67 m etc.) around the curve and the changeover zones, not reproduced."}}], "sourceNote": "Printed page 70: introduction to the 4x100-metre relay race and the plan of the 8-lane track with its dimensions. The printed track diagram is very detailed and its small labels are only partly legible. English and Pashto are our translations (need native review); watermark and footer strip excluded.", "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-13T02:42:55.323731+00:00", "scope": "Scan 72 compared with source", "unresolved": "Translations need native review"}, "paras": [
hpe11Pair("4x100 میٹر دوڑ (ڈاک دوڑ) کے قوانین اور حکمتِ عملی","Rules and Tactics of the 4x100-Metre Race (Relay Race)","د ۴x۱۰۰ مترو منډې (ریلې) قوانین او ستراتیژي",{"id": "hpe11-s072-h1", "kind": "heading"}),
hpe11Pair("ڈاک دوڑ مختلف ٹیموں کے درمیان مقابلہ ہے جس میں ہر ایک ٹیم کا ہر ممبر دوڑ کا ایک حصہ یا مرحلہ دوڑتا ہے۔ ہر ٹیم چھ کھلاڑیوں پر مشتمل ہوتی ہے۔ 4x 100 میٹر دوڑ میں چار کھلاڑی مقابلے میں حصہ لیتے ہیں جو 400 میٹر ٹریک کا مکمل چکر 4 مرحلوں میں مکمل کرتے ہیں۔ پہلے مرحلے کا کھلاڑی بیٹن کے ساتھ دوڑ کا آغاز کرتا ہے۔ وہ 100 میٹر کا پہلا مرحلہ طے کرنے کے بعد بیٹن اپنے ساتھی کو دیتا ہے جو کہ دوسرا مرحلہ دوڑتا ہے۔ اس طرح بیٹن دوسرے سے تیسرے کھلاڑی کے پاس مقررہ فاصلہ طے کرنے کے بعد پہنچتا ہے۔","The relay race is a competition between different teams in which every member of every team runs one part or stage of the race. Every team consists of six players. In the 4x100-metre race four players take part in the competition, who complete the full lap of the 400-metre track in 4 stages. The player of the first stage begins the race with the baton. After covering the first stage of 100 metres he gives the baton to his fellow player, who runs the second stage. In this way the baton reaches the third player from the second after covering the fixed distance.","ریلې منډه د بېلابېلو ټیمونو ترمنځ سیالي ده چې په هغې کې د هر ټیم هر غړی د منډې یوه برخه یا پړاو وهي. هر ټیم له شپږو لوبغاړو جوړ وي. په ۴x۱۰۰ مترو منډه کې څلور لوبغاړي په سیالۍ کې برخه اخلي چې د ۴۰۰ مترو ټریک بشپړ ګردش په ۴ پړاوونو کې بشپړوي. د لومړي پړاو لوبغاړی د بیټن سره د منډې پیل کوي. هغه د ۱۰۰ مترو لومړی پړاو وهلو وروسته بیټن خپل ملګري ته ورکوي چې دویم پړاو وهي. په دې ډول بیټن له دویم نه دریم لوبغاړي ته د ټاکل شوي واټن وهلو وروسته رسېږي.",{"id": "hpe11-s072-p2", "sourceGap": {"note": "The scan reads “ہر ٹیم چھ کھلاڑیوں پر مشتمل ہوتی ہے” (each team consists of six players) although the race has four runners; kept as printed."}})
]});
